{"seq":2,"slug":"extraction-and-transformation","title":"提取与转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/practical-patterns/extraction-and-transformation","wordCount":1045,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"提取与转换\">提取与转换</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从非结构化文本中提取结构化数据、并按目标格式重新组织，是正则替换与捕获分组的高价值应用。其统一思路是：用捕获分组（尤其是命名分组）识别文本的各个部分，再通过分组重排或替换回调完成变形。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提取：捕获分组配合 <code>matchAll</code> 迭代，可从配置、URL 参数、日志等批量抽取键值对。</li>\n<li>转换：借助分组重排与替换函数，一次替换即可完成日期格式、命名风格等结构化变形。</li>\n<li>清洗：按固定顺序串联多次替换，形成可复用的文本清洗流水线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据提取基础\">数据提取基础</h2><h3 id=\"核心思路\">核心思路</h3><ul>\n<li>捕获分组是从非结构化文本中提取结构化数据的利器。</li>\n<li>通过精心设计的模式，可将散乱文本转化为可程序化处理的数据。</li>\n<li>命名分组让提取结果带语义键，直接映射到对象字段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"示例与场景对照\">示例与场景对照</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const logLine = &#39;2026-04-01 14:30:25 [ERROR] Connection timeout after 30s&#39;;&#10;const logPattern = /^(?&lt;date&gt;\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})\\s+(?&lt;time&gt;\\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2})\\s+\\[(?&lt;level&gt;\\w+)\\]\\s+(?&lt;message&gt;.+)$/;&#10;const { groups } = logPattern.exec(logLine);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-04-01 14:30:25 [ERROR] Connection timeout after 30s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logPattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">level</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logPattern.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logLine);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提取场景</th>\n<th>模式设计思路</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定格式文本</td>\n<td>用字面量匹配分隔符</td>\n<td>命名分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键值对</td>\n<td>匹配键和值的通用模式</td>\n<td><code>matchAll</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入在文本中</td>\n<td>用锚点/上下文定位</td>\n<td>前瞻/后顾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复结构</td>\n<td>全局匹配所有实例</td>\n<td><code>g</code> 标志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    TEXT[&quot;非结构化文本&quot;] --&gt; PATTERN[&quot;正则模式&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; GROUPS[&quot;捕获分组&quot;]&#10;    GROUPS --&gt; DATA[&quot;结构化数据&quot;]&#10;    DATA --&gt; JSON[&quot;JSON&quot;]&#10;    DATA --&gt; CSV[&quot;CSV&quot;]&#10;    DATA --&gt; DB[&quot;数据库&quot;]\">graph LR\n    TEXT[\"非结构化文本\"] --&gt; PATTERN[\"正则模式\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; GROUPS[\"捕获分组\"]\n    GROUPS --&gt; DATA[\"结构化数据\"]\n    DATA --&gt; JSON[\"JSON\"]\n    DATA --&gt; CSV[\"CSV\"]\n    DATA --&gt; DB[\"数据库\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"键值对提取\">键值对提取</h2><h3 id=\"常见数据源\">常见数据源</h3><ul>\n<li>从配置文件、URL 参数或日志中提取键值对是高频需求。</li>\n<li>不同数据源的分隔符不同，但模式骨架一致：键、分隔符、值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码与模式\">代码与模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const configText = `&#10;host=localhost&#10;port=3306&#10;database=myapp&#10;timeout=30&#10;`;&#10;&#10;const kvPattern = /^(\\w+)=(.+)$/gm;&#10;const config = {};&#10;for (const [, key, value] of configText.matchAll(kvPattern)) {&#10;  config[key] = value;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const url = &#39;https://example.com?name=Alice&amp;age=30&amp;city=Shanghai&#39;;&#10;const params = {};&#10;const paramPattern = /[?&amp;](\\w+)=([^&amp;#]*)/g;&#10;for (const [, key, value] of url.matchAll(paramPattern)) {&#10;  params[key] = decodeURIComponent(value);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">host=localhost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">port=3306</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database=myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">timeout=30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> kvPattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)=(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configText.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(kvPattern)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  config[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://example.com?name=Alice&#x26;age=30&#x26;city=Shanghai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paramPattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[?&#x26;]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)=(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">&#x26;#]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paramPattern)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  params[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decodeURIComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>分隔符模式</th>\n<th>提取模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置文件</td>\n<td><code>key=value</code></td>\n<td><code>/^(\\w+)=(.+)$/gm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>URL 参数</td>\n<td><code>key=value&amp;</code></td>\n<td><code>/[?&amp;](\\w+)=([^&amp;#]*)/g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 头</td>\n<td><code>Key: Value</code></td>\n<td><code>/^([\\w-]+):\\s*(.+)$/gm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td><code>KEY=VALUE</code></td>\n<td><code>/^([A-Z_]+)=(.*)$/gm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS 属性</td>\n<td><code>property: value</code></td>\n<td><code>/([\\w-]+)\\s*:\\s*([^;]+)/g</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> <code>String.prototype.matchAll()</code> 返回迭代器，配合解构赋值和 <code>for...of</code> 循环，是批量提取数据的最优雅方式。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>matchAll</code> 时正则必须带 <code>g</code> 标志，否则抛出 <code>TypeError</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"格式转换\">格式转换</h2><h3 id=\"适用范围\">适用范围</h3><ul>\n<li>正则替换不仅用于简单文本替换，更是数据格式转换的强大工具。</li>\n<li>借助分组重排与替换回调，可在一次替换里完成结构化变形。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"转换示例\">转换示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const isoDate = &#39;2026-04-01&#39;;&#10;isoDate.replace(/(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})/, &#39;$2/$3/$1&#39;);&#10;&#10;isoDate.replace(/(?&lt;year&gt;\\d{4})-(?&lt;month&gt;\\d{2})-(?&lt;day&gt;\\d{2})/, (...args) =&gt; {&#10;  const { year, month, day } = args.at(-1);&#10;  return `${year}年${month}月${day}日`;&#10;});&#10;&#10;function camelToSnake(str) {&#10;  return str.replace(/[A-Z]/g, (letter) =&gt; `_${letter.toLowerCase()}`);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function snakeToCamel(str) {&#10;  return str.replace(/_([a-z])/g, (_, letter) =&gt; letter.toUpperCase());&#10;}&#10;&#10;camelToSnake(&#39;backgroundColor&#39;);&#10;snakeToCamel(&#39;background_color&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isoDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#